    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2143$48 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 03 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'10'03No. 2143/48 - THURSDAY OCTOBER 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF CHAIRMAN OF THE KAMBURUPITIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66B(2) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BY LOCAL AUHORITIES ELECTIONS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 16 OF 2017\n\nWHEREAS the office of Chairman in Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Death ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWeerasuriya Mudiyanselage Sanjeewa Priyanath the former Chairman belonged, was required by me under Section 66 B(2) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to suchparty who shall be declared selected as Chairman within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid Political Party has communicated his decision to nominateWeerasinghe Kankanamage Ananda Weerasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Thananthiri Withanage Poshitha Kaumadi, Returning Officer of the KamburupitiyaPradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section 66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) asamended by Local Authorities Elections (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 2017 do hereby declare Weerasinghe KankanamageAnanda Weerasinghe elected as Chairman of the Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nT. W. POSHITHA KAUMADI,Returning Officer,Kamburupitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matara,02nd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 635/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
