    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2143$50 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 03 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'10'03No. 2143/50 - THURSDAY OCTOBER 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MEDIRIGIRIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Medirigiriya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to whichKudagamage Asoka Karunasena the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance,to decide upon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified underSection 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a periodof thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Disanayaka Mudiyanselage Amal Disanayaka to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Leelanath Wickrama Arachchi, Returning Officer of the Medirigiriya Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatDisanayaka Mudiyanselage Amal Disanayaka was selected as the member of the Medirigiriya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nLEELANATH WICKRAMA ARACHCHI,Returning Officer,Medirigiriya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Polonnaruwa,03rd October, 2019.\n\n10 - 637\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
