    "chunk_text": "1AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'04PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 04.10.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2143$52 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 04 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'10'04\n\nNo. 2143/52 - FRIDAY, OCTOBER 04, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31179 - 27 (2019/10)\n\n1ST AMENDMENT\n\nService Minute of the Sri Lanka Surveyors\u2019 Service\n\nTHE Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Surveyors\u2019 Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2103/2 dated 24th ofDecember 2018 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka is amended as follows and these amended provisions will bemade effective from 26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministers made the policy decision.\n\nBy order of the Public Service Commission,\n\nM.A.B. DAYA SENARATH ,\n\nSecretary,Public Service Commission.\n\n18th September, 2019.\n\n10.1.1\n\n(ii)Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade III of the category ofservice and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\n(iii) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately preceding the\n\ndate of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\n10.2.1\n\n(i)Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade II of the service andearned six (06) salary increments as at the date of qualifying for promotions.\n\n(iv) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately preceding the\n\ndate of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal."
