    "chunk_text": "(iv) Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately preceding the\n\ndate of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\nThe following note will be included below the qualifications referred to under 10.2.1.\n\nNote:\u2013The officers who are to be promoted to Grade II and have completed the qualifications referred to in the amended 10.1.1 as at26th of February 2019, the date on which the Cabinet of Ministers made the policy decision and the officers who werepromoted to Grade II prior to such date will be promoted to Grade I from the date they complete a period of 12 years of activeand satisfactory service in Grade III and II and all other qualifications referred to under 10.2.1 excluding the qualification in10.2.1(i).\n\n10 - 648\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
