    "chunk_text": "wxl 2144$12 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 08 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'08\n\nNo. 2144/12 \u2013 TUESDAY, OCTOBER 08, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk\n\nG 31198 - 24 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. 5/3/4/1-1937.Ministry of Land and Parliamentary Reforms\n\nReference No.: 4-3/6/2018/HW/63.\n\nI hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964, that the Governmentintends to acquire the following land/Servitude which isrequired for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of Land, containing in extent of 0.2493Hectare, Lots 1- 11 (11 lots) under mentioned land shown inthe Surveyor General\u2019s Preliminary Plan No. Ma-1794 datedon 20.09.2019, situated in the village of Kapuwatta in theGrama Niladhari Division of Kapuwatta (E444 A), in DambullaDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Matale District of CentralProvince.\n\n1. Lot No. 1Name of the Land: Dikyaya; Description of Land: Estate;Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Rangiri DambuluRajamaha Viharaya. Cultivated by I. Wickramanayake,Resident in \u201cThusitha\u201d Isipathana Place, Polonnaruwa;Extent: 0.0267 Hectare.\n\n2. Lot No. 2Name of the Land: Dikyaya; Description of Land: Estate;Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: Rangiri DambuluRajamaha Viharaya. Cultivated by Yapa Mudiyanselage AmaraKumarihamy, Resident in No. 149, Senuwara; Extent: 0.0414Hectare.\n\n3. Lot No. 3Name of the Land: Katupathyaya; Description of Land:Estate; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: RangiriDambulu Rajamaha Viharaya. Cultivated by LeemagahadeniyeGedara Anura Palitha Leemagahadeniya, Resident in Polgollawatta , Polgolla; Extent: 0.0293 Hectare."
