    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'25PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39A(1)\n\nTHE allotments specified in the Order No. 82 of 2013 made underthe Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1802/14 dated 20th March, 2013 is vested absolutely in theState and the possession of which has been taken for or on behalf ofthe State under Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But bythe virtue of powers vested in me by Sub-section (1) of Section39(a) (inserted by Act, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land AcquisitionAct. I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands andParliamentaryReforms, do hereby divest only the alltomentsdescribed in the Schedule 1 below.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/21.Acquiring Officer No.: WGSWD & EIP/ACQ/KB/08.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.26th September, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAllotment of land depicted in below names and extent in theamended Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9470 dated 25.01.2019 preparedby the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village called Divulpitiya,Pepiliyana, Bellanthota in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 535 B,Divulpitiya-West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kesbewaof Colombo District in Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 06 \u2013 Meegahawatta Owita \u2013 Extent: About 0.0611HectareNorth: Lot Nos. 3, 4, 5 and Land bearing Assmt. No. 16/14/A atSri Maha Bodirajarama Road; East: Lot Nos. 4, 5 and Land bearingAssmt. No. 16/14/A at Sri Maha Bodirajarama Road, Land of whichthe Assmt. No. could not be traced and Lot No. 7; South: Lot No. 7;West: Lot No. 3.\n\n10 \u201