    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS Title Registration AMENDMENT REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, NO. 21 OF 1998 (Section 14) In regard to the title to parcel of land No. 78 of Block 06 contained in the Cadastral Map No. 520023 situated in the village of Ku-damaduwa within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 591A Kudamaduwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama in the District of Colombo in the Province of Western published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2099/24 of 29th November, 2018. \u201c0.0519\u201d mentioned in the column \u201cExtent\u201d is amended as \u201cHectare 0.0268\u201d P.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Covering up duties) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 26th September, 2019 10-863/1\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2144/30 - 2019 \u0d94\u0013\u0dd9\u0dad\u0015\u0db6\u0017 09 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001a \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.10.09\n\nNo. 2144/30 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, OCTOBER 09, 2019\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31208 - 14 (2019/10)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba - 2019.10.09 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.10.2019"
