    "chunk_size_bytes": 2026,
    "chunk_text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'11PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.10.20191A\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/05/2018/175.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labourwhich accompanies this order exists between,\n\nMr. W. A. Wijedasa, \u201cNilmini Niwasa\u201d, Nagolla, Kuttiyagolla, Badulla.of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.of the other part\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powersvested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 RevisedEdition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial disputes-Special Provisions) Act,No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. M. E. G. Samaraweera, No. 123/6, Old Kandy Road, Dalugama, Kelaniya to be the arbitratorand refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nRAVINDRA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations.\n\nColombo,07th October, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G31237 \u2013 21 (10/2019)\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nwxl 2144$61 \u2013 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 11 jeks isl=rdod \u2013 2019'10'11No. 2144/61 \u2013 FRIDAY, OCTOBER 11, 2019\n\n2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .