    "chunk_size_bytes": 2044,
    "chunk_text": "Whether injustice had been caused to Mr. Senaka Maithri de Livera who was employed as Senior Manager (Food andBeverages) of the Royal Colombo Golf Club situated at No. 223, Model Farm Road, Colombo 08, by the non-payment of thebonus paid to other employees from 2008 and non-payment of the salary increase given to other employees from January 2009,and if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nDated at the office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, this 30th day of September, 2019.\n\n10 \u2013 954/2\n\n\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/02/2018/52-Sub.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN industrial dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner of Labour whichaccompanies this order exists between,\n\n01. Mr. P. A. M. Ratnapala, Agana Ulpatha, Dabawinna, Welimada.02. Mr. H. M. Nimal Shantha, Tharindu Niwasa, Paragahamula, Walmulla.03. Mr. R. D. Mahinda Rajapakse, Waralla Pathana, Dabawinna, Welimada.04. Mr. Lasitha Senarath Wijesundara, 111, Medahinna, Kinigama, Bandarawela.05. Mr. H. M. Chandana Kumara, Hansika Sevana, Kumbukgolla, Heavanwatta, Mahiyanganaya.06. Mr. W. D. Krishan Wilpola, 334/1, Bambarawana, Dehiattakandiya.of the one part\n\nand\n\nSri Lanka Transport Board, No. 200, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.of the other part\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Ravindra Samaraweera, Minister of Labour and Trade Union Relations do by virtue of the powersvested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 RevisedEdition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes-Special Provisions) Act,No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. M. E. G. Samaraweera, No. 123/6, Old Kandy Road, Dalugama, Kelaniya to be the arbitratorand refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration."
