    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2144/62 - 2019 \u0d94\u00fa\u0dd9\u0dad\u02a4\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 11 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0286\u00fd\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.10.11\n\nNo. 2144/62 \u2013 FRIDAY, OCTOBER, 11, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31238 - 50 (2019/10)\n\nNATIONAL WATER SUPPLY AND DRAINAGE BOARD ACT, No.2 OF 1974\n\nOrder under Section 92\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Rauff Hakeem, the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, here by approve, the acquisition of the immovable property, described in the following schedule, as alternative lands are required by the Na-tional Water Supply and Drainage Board, for the construction of Rattota Pump House and the Access Road of Greater Matale Water Supply Project. RAUFF HAKEEM, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education. Ministry of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, No. 35, ''Lakdiya Medura\", New Parliament Road, Pelawatta, Battaramulla, 02nd October, 2019. 5/2/1/1503\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nFive allotments of land called \u2018\u2018Pansale Kumbura, Pallepela Nawathe Kumbura (a part), Nawathe Kumbura (a part), Amunewela Gedara Watta (a part)\u201d, in total extent of about 1 Rood 38.6 perches, depicted as Lot Nos. 1,2,3,4 and 5 in the Licensed Survey Plan No. 2498, surveyed and prepared by Mr. D.R.M.D. Bandara, the Licensed Surveyor, situated at the village of Bodhikotuwa, in Bodhikotuwa Grama Niladhari Division, No. E 375A, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Rattota in Matale District, Central Province, and bounded as follows.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.11 PART (I): SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.10.2019\n\nSCHEDULE (Contd.) 01. Lot No. : 1"
