    "chunk_text": "4 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.11 PART (I): SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.10.2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nNorth by : Remaining portion of this land East by : Remaining portion of this land South by : Wellathota - Kadduwa Road West by : River Nilwala Name and address of the claimant : 1. Mr. S.G. Saliya Govinda, \u2018\u2018\u00c1yansa\u201d, Gramodaya Mawatha, Karagoda, Uyangoda. 10 - 972\n\nNATIONAL WATER SUPPLY AND DRAINAGE BOARD ACT, No.2 OF 1974\n\nOrder under Section 92 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Rauff Hakeem, the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, here by approve, the acquisition of the immovable property, described in the following schedule, as an additional land is required by the National Water Supply and Drainage Board, for the Access road to the Jambughapitiya Service Reservoir of Kandy North - Pathadumbara Integrated Water Supply Project. RAUFF HAKEEM, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education. Ministry of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, No. 35, ''Lakdiya Medura\", New Parliament Road, Pelawatta, Battaramulla, 02nd October, 2019. 5/2/1/1507\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nAll that allotment of land called Woodthorpe Estate, in total extent of about 01 perches, situated at the village of Bogahakumbura, in Bogahakumbura Grama Niladhari Division, No. 626, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pathadumbura in Kandy District, Central Province, and bounded as follows.\n\nName of the Land : Woodthorpe Estate Extent : 01 perches\n\n5A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.11 PART (I): SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 11.10.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nSCHEDULE (Contd.) Boundaries :"
